{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:7ca7010ba19aece6","name":"Mobile Scout Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-7ca7010ba19aece6","title":"Mobile Scout Talent Tree","revision":21386,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:42:16Z","sha256":"bab39b431d76bf6cd1c6b97eef8f0e0c96722acfdf4861fa7bb5d2df6391986c","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21386","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Mobile%20Scout%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-7ca7010ba19aece6","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Always mobile, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scouts"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scouts"}," have developed ways to ride and drive over all types of terrain.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Battle Mount"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ride"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ride","referenceId":"reference:439efdc566bb419f"},", ",{"tag":"b","children":["Expert Rider"]},", ",{"tag":"b","children":["Terrain Guidance"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You know how to fight from a living mount. You can use each of the following actions once per encounter:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Covered Attack:"]}," Once per encounter, when you use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Mount as Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Mount_as_Cover"}," (but not ",{"tag":"a","children":["Improved Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Improved_Cover"},") aspect of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ride"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ride","referenceId":"reference:439efdc566bb419f"}," skill, you can make an attack as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", but you must have a free hand to do so."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reduce Profile:"]}," You gain additional ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cover"}," from your mount. When you succeed in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Mount as Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Mount_as_Cover"}," application of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ride"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ride","referenceId":"reference:439efdc566bb419f"}," skill, you gain ",{"tag":"a","children":["Improved Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Improved_Cover"},". If you fail by less than 10, you still gain the benefit of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cover"},". You gain no benefit if you fail by 10 or more."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Swift Attack Mount:"]}," Once per encounter, the mount you are riding can make an attack as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," instead of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},"."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Expert Rider"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ride"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ride","referenceId":"reference:439efdc566bb419f"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can reroll any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ride"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ride","referenceId":"reference:439efdc566bb419f"}," check, but the result of the reroll must be accepted, even if it is worse.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Mechanized Rider"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ride"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ride","referenceId":"reference:439efdc566bb419f"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You use your riding experience to improve your skills on a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speeder"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speeder"}," or a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swoop Bike"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swoop_Bike"},". When riding a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speeder"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speeder"}," or a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swoop Bike"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swoop_Bike"}," (or another, similar ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"},"), you can use the following applications of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ride"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ride","referenceId":"reference:439efdc566bb419f"}," skill: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fast Mount or Dismount"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fast_Mount_or_Dismount"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Soft Fall"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Soft_Fall"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stay in Saddle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stay_in_Saddle"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Mount as Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Mount_as_Cover"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Terrain Guidance"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ride"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ride","referenceId":"reference:439efdc566bb419f"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You effectively guide your mount through rough terrain. When in control of your mount, you can make a DC 20 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ride"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ride","referenceId":"reference:439efdc566bb419f"}," check as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," to negate the effect of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Difficult Terrain"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Difficult_Terrain"}," on your mount's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
